# Normalise line endings so a save in STS does not rewrite every file.
#
# Without this, Eclipse writes CRLF on Windows, the repository holds LF, and git
# reports every line of every file as changed. A pull request then shows dozens
# of fully-rewritten files, review is impossible, and anyone else touching the
# same file gets a conflict over invisible characters.
#
# `text=auto` means: store LF in the repository, check out whatever is native.
# The other four services already carry the two lines below; this file adds the
# normalisation rule they are missing.

* text=auto

/mvnw text eol=lf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
